{
  "conformance": "source.title-family",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "status": "ruled",
  "table": {
    "tableId": "events-marketing",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "basis": [
    "a job title's buyer family, derived at admission by a declared, versioned table; both runtimes evaluate it the same way"
  ],
  "rule": "Each vector's title is evaluated against input.table when the vector carries one, and otherwise against the table named in table (title-family/tables/<tableId>.v<major>.json), by title-family/EVALUATION.md: normalize (NFKD, combining marks dropped, lowercase, every run outside [a-z0-9] one space, trim; empty is absent), apply abbreviations token by token, then exclusions first (other), the first matching function, the first matching level (no level is other). An entry is normalized by the same steps, abbreviations included (an entry that normalizes to empty matches nothing), and matches as a contiguous whole-word token sequence. expect is the family, or absent when the title is absent or normalizes to empty.",
